  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Five-minute next-day was and were retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You retrieved singular and plural positive forms and both negative contractions from explicit event evidence.">
      <h3>Choose the past form from the event update</h3>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day was and were choices">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="was">was</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="were">were</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="wasn’t">wasn’t</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="weren’t">weren’t</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>The photo shows every seat occupied: The main hall <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="was" data-hint="The photo confirms a positive state, and the singular main hall takes was." data-fix="The main hall was crowded." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> crowded.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>The room list shows two unused rooms: Two rooms <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="were" data-hint="The list confirms a positive state, and two rooms takes were." data-fix="Two rooms were available." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> available.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The technician replaced the broken projector: The projector <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="wasn’t" data-hint="Replacing the broken device supports a negative singular state: wasn’t ready." data-fix="The projector wasn’t ready." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> ready.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>The attendance log shows every volunteer arrived before nine: The volunteers <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="weren’t" data-hint="Every early arrival supports the negative plural state weren’t late." data-fix="The volunteers weren’t late." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> late.</span></div>
      <div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-choices>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-choices>Reset</button></div>
      <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
    </div>
    <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="Did" data-hint="A past question with be begins directly with Was or Were; it does not need did." data-fix="Was the room quiet?" data-why="Was and were make their own past questions by moving before the subject.">
      <h3>Repair the past question</h3>
      <p>The report asks about one room: “Did the room quiet?” Tap the one question word that must change.</p>
      <div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="Did">Did</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="room">the room</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="quiet">quiet?</button></div>
      <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
    </div>
    <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
      <h3>Thirty-second retrieval</h3>
      <p>Without looking back, report one fictional singular past state, one plural past state, one negative, one yes/no question with a short answer, and one information question with its answer.</p>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button>
      <p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The workshop was useful. The rooms were quiet. The projector wasn’t ready. Was Maya at reception? Yes, she was. Where were the visitors? They were in the main hall.</strong></p>
